  "summary": "Malicious code in broadcast-graphics-mcp (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook (postinstall.js) runs automatically on install. It collects host metadata — hostname, platform, architecture, Node version, and the npm lifecycle event — and POSTs it as JSON over HTTPS to 2obx43du[.]instances[.]poc[.]jchunt[.]top/broadcast-graphics-mcp. The beacon transmits system fingerprint data to the remote host on every install.",
